    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d54">

                <pb facs="0215" n="97" xml:id="pg97"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.4215 Air Pollution/83: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Canada</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Phillips</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ottawa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-08-02T15:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 2,
                                1928—3 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 4:35 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>167. Your 103, August 1, 6 p.m. Under Secretary of State for External Affairs
                    informally states the matter will be at once referred to the Prime Minister and
                    considers that there is no doubt of immediate reference in the form
                    proposed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
